cutions":343,"ProtocolSubmissions":0},"Scope":"Local phase diagnostic. Construction includes the route\u0027s query/parameter/stream construction and result List. Submit-to-first-row includes GetAsyncEnumerator/first MoveNextAsync/first DTO mapping. Read-complete includes all remaining rows and EOF. Release includes enumerator retirement and dynamic query disposal. All routes materialize and verify the complete List with the same mapper. Fluent and prepared SQL text are identical. SQLite raw SQL numbers ? markers; all routes bind the same ordered Int64 values. PostgreSQL markers are identical. Preparation and first execution are reported separately; SQL rendering and shared metadata setup precede the first route executions, which are not independent process-cold measurements. Window allocation and GC are whole process; phase samples are timestamp durations, not thread-local allocation attribution. CPU/RSS are local process observations. Protocol submissions are not physical network-round-trip measurements. No hosted-runner identity is required. Failure diagnostics add scalar progress/stage assignments within the existing windows and phase boundaries; no per-operation logging or diagnostic counter reads occur on success."}
